      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a screenplay for a new noir crime drama. it's set in a really gritty, decaying metro city. i need some help fleshing out some side characters to make the street level feel authentic. can u help me come up with like 4 or 5 descriptions for some low-level criminals or guys hanging out on the corners? i want them to feel like they actually belong in those rougher parts of town.",
