      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are some side character descriptions that fit the gritty, decaying metro city:\n\n1. Vinnie \"The Bull\" LaRosa, a short, stout Italian-American with a thick neck and a temper to match. He's always sporting a scruffy beard and a black leather jacket, and has a habit of cracking his knuckles when he's nervous. He's a small-time enforcer for a local gang, and isn't afraid to use his size and aggression to get what he wants.\n\n2. Lil' Juan, a scrawny, 19-year-old Latino with a messy mop of black hair and a perpetual air of desperation. He's always dressed in tattered jeans and a faded band t-shirt, and has a habit of fidgeting with a silver chain that he wears around his neck. He's a small-time hustler, always looking for ways to make a quick buck or score a fix.\n\n3. Bubba \"The Kid\" Jackson, a lanky, 25-year-old African American with a shaved head and a perpetual grin. He's always dressed in the latest streetwear trends, and has a habit of flashing a gold chain and a diamond-encrusted watch. He's a small-time",
